      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Excel Solar responded quickly to my request for a quote, were very professional, and took the installation through to the point that Ergon only had to put in the required meter for connection to the grid. The worst service came from Ergon Energy. We had the solar panels installed for 5 weeks before Ergon came to connect us to the electricity grid. We have just recieved our first electricity bill since installation, and there is a dramatic difference. I notice though, that Ergon are taking advantage of the fact that we recieve our farm electricity on the same bill. Although the panels are installed on the domestic supply, Ergon are taking our domestic usage as well as our farm usage off the total that we input into the grid. I feel that this is a bit unfair considering the investment we have made.",
